  "title": "30 Named Hurricanes in 2020 Breaks Record",
  "summary": "While it may not have been the No. 1 headline of the year (we all know what that was), the 2020 hurricane season certainly was worthy of top billing. It was record-breaking; insurers had to operate and respond to customers in new ways, and again, the hurricane can teach us, as an industry, something to apply to the 2021 season.",
